  "reason": "The only completed experiment is a multimodal single-profile PCA+ResNet50 model with validation accuracy 0.527 and F1 0.510, which is too sparse to determine whether multimodality is actually helping. Testing config_010, an image-only single-profile ResNet50 baseline, isolates the contribution of the image modality while keeping the image encoder and profile setting aligned with config_016. If image-only performs similarly, RNA PCA may be adding little; if it performs much worse, the multimodal result is more promising and justifies further exploration of fusion and RNA encoders. This is a high-information baseline under a limited budget."
}

